// Wish data from the previous year's Kurszuordnung_V2.xlsx spreadsheet,
// analysed in spec/prior-art/kurszuordnung-v2.md. The spreadsheet records
// only anonymised names ("Kind 01" to "Kind 66"), course letters A to M and up to
// three ordered wishes per child.
//
// The spreadsheet has no age, audience, capacity, space or leader data, so this
// fixture assumes: every child is 10, every course is a children's course in
// assigned mode for ages 6 to 14 with capacity 66, five spaces hold 66 people,
// and no course has a leader. Courses are entered in letter order, so automatic
// first-feasible placement follows that order. Placements and capacity variants
// are applied by workshop-assignment-kurszuordnung-v2.test.ts.

WorkshopSpaceAdded workshop_space_id="wsp_raum_1" name="Raum 1" location_description="Raum 1" capacity=66 sort_key=1
